world, show off your unique style with a **massive selection of unlockable cosmetics**, and dive into a variety of exciting **minigames**.\n\nWhether you are chasing friends in competitive modes or exploring hidden corners of the map, there is always something to do.\n\n> **Grab your headset, master the movement, and join the community today!**\n", "short_description": "Welcome to Tamarins VR, the ultimate classic-style VR fan game bringing back nostalgic 2023 community vibes. Swing, slide, and race through maps using physics-based hand-movement locomotion. Jump into fast-paced minigames, unlock cool cosmetics to style your character, and hang out in public lobbies or private codes with friends."}]}, "developer_name": "Marshy industries", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/tamarins-vr/privacy-policy?authuser=0", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/tamarins-vr/home?authuser=0", "publisher_name": "M&P Games", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/tamarins-vr/home", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_SOME", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "459781504968480"}, {"id": "1023770785722696"}, {"id": "528142316460358"}], "external_subscription_type": "REQUIRED_FOR_SOME_CONTENT", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["HAND_TRACKING", "OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["STANDING", "ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["MULTI_USER", "CO_OP"], "id": "1365467596645265"}}]}, "scheduled_offers": {"count": 0, "nodes": []}, "baseline_offer": null, "is_approved": true, "firstOffer": {"nodes": []}, "liveChannel": {"nodes": [{"late